4.1 Task 2.1 — Add Smooth Locomotion

Add ContinuousMoveProvider to the XR Origin
Set Move Speed to 2 m/s
Add ContinuousTurnProvider — set Turn Speed to 60°/s
Replace with SnapTurnProvider — set Turn Amount to 45°



